ARM: no accelerated Android emulator
Reclaim risk if idle', '₹0-tier CI runner + agent sandbox', 'adopt', 'USE as free secondary/overflow box; never as the only CI or production host.', 'evaluating', '[{"url": "https://docs.oracle.com/en-us/iaas/Content/FreeTier/resourceref.htm", "checked": "2026-10-23"}, {"url": "https://infoq.com/news/2026/07/oracle-cloud-free-tier-limits/", "checked": "2026-10-23"}, {"url": "https://community.oracle.com/CustomerConnect/discussions/tagged/arm", "checked": "2026-10-23"}]'::jsonb, 2),
  ('Netcup Root Server RS G12.5 (dedicated cores)', 'compute', 'Dedicated-CPU CI runner / AI agents / dev / staging; possible prod', 'RS 1000: 4 ded. cores/8 GB/128 GB; RS 2000: 8 ded. cores/16 GB/256 GB; RS 4000: 12/32 GB', 25.4, 2410.0, '', 'Prices shown: RS 1000 €21.73, RS 2000 €40.70, RS 4000 €77.83 (12-month term; page labelling ambiguous, ~€25 incl. 19% VAT for RS 1000; non-EU business customers normally not charged VAT). 1/12/24-month terms (13%/26% discount). Locations: Nuremberg, Vienna, Manassas, Singapore. Netcup raised prices for existing contracts ~18.5% from 2026-05-01.', 'Dedicated cores = no credit throttle
