  ('Netcup vServer ARM64 G12.5', 'compute', 'Cheap ARM runner / agents', 'VPS 1000 ARM 4 vC/8 GB €14.50; VPS 2000 ARM 8 vC/16 GB €26.92 (excl. VAT, 12-mo)', 17.0, 1610.0, '', 'Shared vCores (fair use; third-party review says sustained 100% load is throttled). Ampere Altra Max.', 'Lots of ARM cores per €
