  ('DaruhisOcean Droplets', 'compute', 'Managed-feel VPS in Bangalore', 'Basic 4 vCPU/8 GB $48; CPU-Optimized (dedicated) 2/4 GB $42, 4/8 GB $84; General Purpose 4/16 GB $126', 84.0, 7980.0, '', 'Powered-off droplets still billed; backups +20%. BLR region exists.', 'Bangalore DC (low India latency)
